save(297,dict(paragraphs=["Satyaranjan Praharaj writes mainly poetry in Odia, alongside short fiction. In an author note published by Odisha Sahitya, he recalls beginning to write during his college years and identifies Michha Jahnarati, published in 2021, as his first poetry collection.","The poems gathered here explore the difficulty of giving an account of an inner life. ‘ସାକ୍ଷାତକାର’ stages an interview in which a child's smile resists the accounting of achievement and loss, while ‘ନ ଥିବାର ଦିନ’ fills absence with searching, imagined presences and silence. ‘ନିଘୋଡ’ moves through sleep and cosmic transformation toward an appeal to wake and love again. In ‘ଆଡପାଗଳା’, wounds, roots and soil give estrangement a physical shape."],sources=[source('Odisha Sahitya — Mukhagni and author note, 13 December 2023','https://odishasahitya.com/mukhagni/','First-person note: college writing beginnings, mainly poetry and some stories, first collection Michha Jahnarati2021. Matching Bhubaneswar locality in poem484 and identical debut title in captured biography.')],identity_match='Exact author name, identical debut collection and matching Aerodrome Area/Bhubaneswar byline connect outside author note with captured biography and original poem484.',poems_read=[dict(id=317,title='ନ ଥିବାର ଦିନ',coverage='Complete original',basis='Absence, seeking, imagined cosmic gifts, exhaustion and silence.'),dict(id=484,title='ସାକ୍ଷାତକାର',coverage='Complete original',basis='Interview frame; accounting/debts, child smile, withheld answers.'),dict(id=723,title='ନିଘୋଡ',coverage='Complete original',basis='Deep sleep, cosmic dreams, creation/destruction and waking appeal.'),dict(id=750,title='ଆଡପାଗଳା',coverage='Complete original',basis='Speaking wounds, estrangement, cutting roots and soil/seed recognition.')],limitations=['Captured Secretariat employment not independently verified as current; no employment assertion added. No publisher/catalogue link verified for debut, so shelf remains empty. Poetic grief, madness and relationships are not personal biographical facts.'],search_queries=['Satyaranjan Praharaj','ସତ୍ୟରଞ୍ଜନ ପ୍ରହରାଜ କବି','ମିଛ ଜହ୍ନରାତି ପ୍ରହରାଜ'],research_leads=[dict(url='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZEYosDhhATg',access='indexed_title_description_only',finding='2024review explicitly pairs author and Michha Jahnarati; video not watched, no additional claims taken.'),dict(url='https://worksodisha.blogspot.com/2022/03/',access='opened_page',finding='Same-name OSS association candidate, not sufficient to verify current employment.'),dict(url='https://odishasambad.in/sabudina-sahitya-a-poem-by-satyaranjan-praharaj-1/',access='search_index',finding='Published Rumal poem; additional publication lead, no new biography taken.')],next_action='Author/editor review and publisher link for Michha Jahnarati.'))
